{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14213390","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14213390","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:3:1421339001:1":{"text":"ああ！偉大なるイーナ様のご判断は間違っていなかった！","source_cn":"呵！伟大的伊娜领袖的判断果然从无错漏！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF7EB9350DFA0CFC2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1421339002:1":{"text":"憎き保守派め、やはりよそ者を引き連れて我らがドワーフの聖域を汚しに来たな！","source_cn":"可憎的守旧者果然引领着外来之民踏足我等矮人的圣域！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x736083333616CD44","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1421339003:1":{"text":"……えっと、厳密にはとんがり耳の縄張りなんだけど……まあ、いっか……","source_cn":"……呃，照理说这里其实应该算是尖耳朵的地盘内……算了，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDF1465AAC37B1F89","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1421339004:1":{"text":"イーナはこの中にいるのか？なんでこの場所を知ってたんだ？","source_cn":"孩子们，伊娜就在里面吗？你们怎么发现的这个地方？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2A71E7486D3ECD94","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1421339005:1":{"text":"復興の希望の光が、我らを導いてくれたのだ！","source_cn":"复兴的希望之光引领着我们，而我们将振翅腾飞！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x68373C6BD87E779D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1421339006:1":{"text":"ここでなら、イーナ様の研究もさらなる躍進を遂げるはず！まさに竜に翼を得たる如しだ！","source_cn":"伊娜领袖的研究突飞猛进，让我们本就强大的力量更加如虎添翼！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5222166620BE6D6A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1421339007:1":{"text":"さあ、保守派の裏切り者とよそ者どもよ――","source_cn":"来吧，给这些老旧的叛徒和外来人——","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xAE7D9F772B21BFFF","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"さあ、保守派の裏切り者とよそ者どもよ――","female":"さあ、保守派の裏切り者とよそ者どもよ――","variant_male_record_index":"163761","variant_female_record_index":"163762","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1421339008:1":{"text":"覚悟しろ！","source_cn":"一点颜色看看！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x56388F58703D085F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:芝琳":{"text":"チーリン","source":"芝琳","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:布乔":{"text":"ブジョー","source":"布乔","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:祖娅":{"text":"ゾーヤ","source":"祖娅","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":9,"localized_text_count":8,"speaker_count":3}}